{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQJX6DVaMMLYBQXvve3J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't write an implementation plan for #245. I set the status to `needs-human` because the issue leaves three design decisions open:\n\n- **Registry:** which registry holds the role images, and whether it is public or private. A private one needs imagePullSecrets support in the executor and the chart. It would also contradict the proposal's current \"no pull secrets\" statement.\n- **Base image:** which published agent image the role Dockerfiles start from on the cluster path, since the local-only `ard-agent` image isn't pullable there.\n- **Build timing:** whether role images are built in CI and pinned by digest, or built at runtime. That decides whether the Jenkinsfile and `deploy/` change, and those are protected paths that need human approval.\n\nThe lead's triage note passed these choices to me. They are product choices rather than code ones, so I left them for a maintainer. I only skimmed `.ard/config.yaml` and the lead's note; I didn't read the executor code or write any steps. I left `plan.md` untouched.\n\nI wrote `.ard/245/triage-engineer.md` with the open questions. Once they're answered, the issue can be re-triaged. My rough estimate for the work is size L with medium risk."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":604,"cache_read_input_tokens":11287,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":604},"output_tokens":388,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c109764f-1cf6-4dfd-96a4-80a136018db0","uuid":"98383d8c-5508-4d3f-8fa2-1e31ca2f727a","timestamp":"2026-11-25T20:47:48.520Z","request_id":"req_011ChQJX65pKjDqvLjZCce2y"}
